            For most homes, one can of Zinsser Bulls Eye 1-2-3 handles new drywall, patches, trim and light stains, and a quart of Zinsser B-I-N handles the stains and odors that nothing else stops. That pair covers the large majority of priming jobs.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
